Where did the day go? — a launch film for Cadence
==================================================

Product, name and app icon
  Cadence — https://github.com/SuzalShrestha/cadence (MIT). The icon is drawn from build/icon.svg in that repository.

Picture
  All interface elements, data and motion are original and drawn in code (Canvas 2D).
  The day, projects, clients and numbers shown are illustrative sample data.

Type (SIL Open Font License 1.1, files and licences in fonts/)
  Inter — Rasmus Andersson — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/inter
  Inter Tight — Rasmus Andersson — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/intertight
  JetBrains Mono — JetBrains — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/jetbrainsmono

Music (original score, score.py)
  Samples (CC0): Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL), Versilian Studios — https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL
  Instruments: marimba, vibraphone (soft mallets), bowed vibraphone, glockenspiel. Pulse and shaker synthesized.

Sound effects
  Synthesized procedurally (mix.py). No recorded sound effects.

Voice
  Kokoro-82M text-to-speech (Apache-2.0), voice af_heart, via kokoro-onnx — https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx
  Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT).
